## Modifications from ogallotti/rtk-hermes v1.2.3

This project is a fork of [ogallotti/rtk-hermes](https://github.com/ogallotti/rtk-hermes)
(v1.2.3, MIT License).

Changes made:
- **Removed pip/setuptools packaging** — adapted from a pip-installable package
  to a pure directory plugin. No virtualenv or pip required; drop the folder
  into `~/.hermes/plugins/rtk-rewrite/` and Hermes discovers it automatically.
- **Removed `pyproject.toml` entry points** — the `register(ctx)` function
  works directly via Hermes' native plugin discovery.
- **Core rewrite logic unchanged** — all `rtk rewrite` delegation, preview
  marker (`: RTK &&`), mode switching (`rewrite`/`suggest`/`off`), backend
  control, and `/rtk` slash command are preserved from upstream.

Upstream: https://github.com/ogallotti/rtk-hermes
RTK (required binary): https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk
